==Location and Uses==
==={{BotW|-}}===
{{Compendium/Extract|Hearty Durian}}
Hearty Durians are found growing on trees in wooded areas of the Faron Grasslands. They're purchasable from the travelling merchant, [[Chumin]], as well [[Lorn's Fruit Stand]] in [[Gerudo Town]]. Red [[Hinox]]es have the potential to drop Hearty Durians when killed.

Hearty Durians can be eaten raw to restore three [[Heart]]s, but they can also be roasted by direct flames to become [[Roasted Hearty Durian]]s. If one or more are [[Cooking|cooked]] into a dish in a [[Cooking Pot]], they will grant the [[Extra Hearts]] [[Added Effect]]. At the [[Kochi Dye Shop]], Hearty Durians are one of the ingredients that can be used to make Light Yellow [[Dye|Hateno Dye]].

Hearty Durians, as well as other fruits, can be used in a [[Cooking Pot]] to make [[Fruit]]-based Meals: 
